      "text": "Character Death or Insanity\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,96,124]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-character-death-or-insanity:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If your character is killed (goes to 0\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,124,163]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-character-death-or-insanity:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Life) or becomes insane (goes to 0\n",
